# Runtime user state, not source. The mod rewrites this on EVERY hotkey press,
# so tracking it would make every commit look dirty and bury real code changes.
# Safe to ignore: read_settings() falls back to defaults when the file is
# missing, and save_current() recreates it (with its comment header) on the
# first toggle. For a public release, ship a copy of it alongside the zip so
# users can pre-configure before first launch.
settings.ini

